{"id":"e3431f010302a725","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-zfc-inner-comparison-map.md","title":"ZFC Inner Comparison Map","display":"df-zfc-inner-comparison-map — ZFC Inner Comparison Map","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-inner-comparison-map","aliases":["58-df-zfc-inner-comparison-map"],"display":"df-zfc-inner-comparison-map — ZFC Inner Comparison Map","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-iteration-tree.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-inner-comparison-map"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-inner-comparison-map</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-inner-comparison-map — ZFC Inner Comparison Map"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"92fbda0605a6cb98\" href=\"?note=92fbda0605a6cb98\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-zfc-iteration-tree.md\">../batch03/58-df-zfc-iteration-tree.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,N\">\\(M,N\\)</span> (premice or iterable inner-model structures)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> (common last model)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T,\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal T,\\mathcal U\\)</span> (iteration trees on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,N\">\\(M,N\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha,\\beta\">\\(\\alpha,\\beta\\)</span> (their last indices)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i^{\\mathcal T}_{0\\alpha}\">\\(i^{\\mathcal T}_{0\\alpha}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i^{\\mathcal U}_{0\\beta}\">\\(i^{\\mathcal U}_{0\\beta}\\)</span> (iteration maps)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IterationTree}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{IterationTree}_S\\)</span> (iteration-tree predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"92fbda0605a6cb98\" href=\"?note=92fbda0605a6cb98\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-zfc-iteration-tree.md\">../batch03/58-df-zfc-iteration-tree.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcInnerComparisonMap}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcInnerComparisonMap}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner\\text{-}comparison\\text{-}map}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcInnerComparisonMap}_S(i,j,M,N,P)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\mathcal T,\\mathcal U,\\alpha,\\beta\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{IterationTree}_S(\\mathcal T,M,\\alpha+1)\\land\\mathrm{IterationTree}_S(\\mathcal U,N,\\beta+1)\\land P=M_\\alpha^{\\mathcal T}=M_\\beta^{\\mathcal U}\\land i=i^{\\mathcal T}_{0\\alpha}\\land j=i^{\\mathcal U}_{0\\beta}\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner\\text{-}comparison\\text{-}map}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcInnerComparisonMap}_S(i,j,M,N,P)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\mathcal T,\\mathcal U,\\alpha,\\beta\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{IterationTree}_S(\\mathcal T,M,\\alpha+1)\\land\\mathrm{IterationTree}_S(\\mathcal U,N,\\beta+1)\\land P=M_\\alpha^{\\mathcal T}=M_\\beta^{\\mathcal U}\\land i=i^{\\mathcal T}_{0\\alpha}\\land j=i^{\\mathcal U}_{0\\beta}\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Comparison maps must arise as iteration maps into the same last model. Arbitrary elementary embeddings into a common target do not by themselves constitute an inner-model comparison.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-zfc-iteration-tree.md","status":"resolved","id":"92fbda0605a6cb98","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-iteration-tree.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-zfc-iteration-tree.md","status":"resolved","id":"92fbda0605a6cb98","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IterationTree}_S$ (iteration-tree predicate, see [[../batch03/58-df-zfc-iteration-tree.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M,N","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal T,\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"M,N","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha,\\beta","display":false},{"tex":"i^{\\mathcal T}_{0\\alpha}","display":false},{"tex":"i^{\\mathcal U}_{0\\beta}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IterationTree}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcInnerComparisonMap}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner\\text{-}comparison\\text{-}map}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcInnerComparisonMap}_S(i,j,M,N,P)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\mathcal T,\\mathcal U,\\alpha,\\beta\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{IterationTree}_S(\\mathcal T,M,\\alpha+1)\\land\\mathrm{IterationTree}_S(\\mathcal U,N,\\beta+1)\\land P=M_\\alpha^{\\mathcal T}=M_\\beta^{\\mathcal U}\\land i=i^{\\mathcal T}_{0\\alpha}\\land j=i^{\\mathcal U}_{0\\beta}\\Bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1426,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2328","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerp